# Linux 3.0.101 Kernel Defconfig Fragment for Android 9.0 Pie (LineageOS 16.0 - Android Go)
# Append to arch/arm/configs/lineageos_i9082_defconfig -> lineageos_i9082_pie_go_defconfig

# === Multi-context Android Binder (MANDATORY for Android 8.0+ / 9.0 Pie HIDL) ===
CONFIG_ANDROID_BINDER_IPC=y
CONFIG_ANDROID_BINDER_DEVICES="binder,hwbinder,vndbinder"

# === 512 MB ZRAM Compressed Swap for 1 GB RAM Multitasking ===
CONFIG_SWAP=y
CONFIG_ZRAM=y
CONFIG_ZSMALLOC=y
CONFIG_CRYPTO_LZO=y
CONFIG_CRYPTO_LZ4=y

# === Cgroups & Process Accounting (Required by Pie init / lmkd / storaged) ===
CONFIG_CGROUPS=y
CONFIG_CGROUP_CPUACCT=y
CONFIG_CGROUP_SCHED=y
CONFIG_CGROUP_FREEZER=y
CONFIG_MEMCG=y
CONFIG_MEMCG_SWAP=y

# === Netfilter / qtaguid / rpfilter (Required by Pie netd) ===
CONFIG_NETFILTER_XT_MATCH_QTAGUID=y
CONFIG_IP_NF_MATCH_RPFILTER=y
CONFIG_IP6_NF_MATCH_RPFILTER=y
CONFIG_NETFILTER_XT_MATCH_QUOTA2=y

# === Storage & Filesystems (FUSE / F2FS / EXT4) ===
CONFIG_FUSE_FS=y
CONFIG_EXT4_FS=y
CONFIG_EXT4_FS_SECURITY=y
CONFIG_F2FS_FS=y
CONFIG_F2FS_FS_XATTR=y
CONFIG_F2FS_FS_SECURITY=y

# === SELinux & Security ===
CONFIG_SECURITY=y
CONFIG_SECURITY_NETWORK=y
CONFIG_SECURITY_SELINUX=y
CONFIG_AUDIT=y

# === Low-RAM & Performance Tuning ===
CONFIG_IOSCHED_BFQ=y
CONFIG_DEFAULT_BFQ=y
CONFIG_ANDROID_LOW_MEMORY_KILLER=y
CONFIG_KSM=n
